    "onion_2026": "Onion is unusually expensive this season - national retail ~Rs 52/kg, up ~90% year-on-year, Delhi-NCR crossing Rs 60/kg. The planner is told to avoid onion-heavy gravies while this holds. Correct the price in-app once it settles.",
    "leafy_winter": "Dec-Feb is when palak, methi and sarson are cheapest and most nutritious per rupee in the North. The planner leans hard on them in winter, which is also when a tight budget is easiest to hit."
